@* File: Plugins/DashEvolution/_ViewImports.cshtml *@
@* REQUIRED for the dynamic-plugin build. Without these @addTagHelper
   directives, views compiled into this assembly do NOT get:
     1. CSPInlineScriptTagHelper (BTCPayServer.Abstractions) — which nonces
        every inline <script> so it passes the checkout page's
        "script-src 'self' 'nonce-*'" Content-Security-Policy. Without the
        nonce the browser BLOCKS the DashEvolutionCheckoutBody Vue component
        registration and the checkout renders no QR code / address.
     2. The <vc:*> ViewComponent tag helpers (BTCPayServer), e.g.
        <vc:truncate-center> in DashEvolutionMethodCheckout.cshtml.
   In the built-in (fork) build this happens implicitly via BTCPayServer's
   root _ViewImports.cshtml; a standalone plugin must declare it itself. *@
@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
@addTagHelper *, BTCPayServer
@addTagHelper *, BTCPayServer.Abstractions
